    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are FinPilot's financial transaction categorization agent.\n\nAnalyze this transaction:\n\nMerchant: {{ $json.merchant }}\nAmount: ₹{{ $json.amount }}\nType: {{ $json.type }}\nDate: {{ $json.date }}\n\nChoose exactly ONE category from:\n\n- Food\n- Transport\n- Shopping\n- Entertainment\n- Bills\n- Subscription\n- Healthcare\n- Education\n- Rent\n- Salary\n- Other\n\nThen determine an appropriate subcategory.\n\nExamples:\n\nSwiggy → Food → Food Delivery\nZomato → Food → Food Delivery\nUber → Transport → Cab\nAmazon → Shopping → Online Shopping\nNetflix → Subscription → Entertainment Subscription\nSpotify → Subscription → Music Subscription\nAirtel → Bills → Mobile Bill\nElectricity Board → Bills → Electricity\nApollo Hospital → Healthcare → Medical\nCollege Fee → Education → Tuition\nHouse Rent → Rent → Monthly Rent\nCompany Salary → Salary → Monthly Salary\n\nRules:\n1. The category MUST be exactly one of the categories listed above.\n2. The subcategory should be specific and relevant to the merchant.\n3. Do not create additional top-level categories.\n4. Return ONLY valid JSON.\n5. Do not include markdown or explanations.\n\nOutput format:\n\n[{\n  \"category\": \"Food\",\n  \"subcategory\": \"Food Delivery\"\n}]",
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3.1,
      "position": [
        -1056,
        -112
      ],
      "id": "1b2f7e42-81f5-473c-a219-19820678298e",
      "name": "AI Agent1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "return items.map(item => {\n  const data = item.json;\n\n  return {\n    json: {\n      user_name:data.user_name,\n      date: data.date,\n      merchant: data.description,\n      amount: Number(data.amount),\n      type: data.type?.toUpperCase() === 'DEBIT' ? 'expense' : 'income',\n      category: null,\n      subcategory: null\n    }\n  };\n});;"
